[
  {
    "start": 19.16,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "Mandingo"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.88,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "Welcome back to the channel, guys. Blood"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.84,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "Outdoors Show. Me and young Chris back"
  },
  {
    "start": 29.2,
    "duration": 1.68,
    "text": "in the Lake District."
  },
  {
    "start": 30.16,
    "duration": 1.88,
    "text": "Two rights."
  },
  {
    "start": 30.88,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "text": "Going to be a good one, mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 32.04,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "Two rights is this."
  },
  {
    "start": 32.8,
    "duration": 4.6,
    "text": "Today we're going for a wild camp"
  },
  {
    "start": 35.28,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "on the summit of Robinson."
  },
  {
    "start": 37.4,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "Well, we might go in the summit. We"
  },
  {
    "start": 39.2,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "might not. We'll see what it's like when"
  },
  {
    "start": 40.56,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "we get there."
  },
  {
    "start": 41.68,
    "duration": 2.44,
    "text": "But that's where we're going, up on the"
  },
  {
    "start": 43.36,
    "duration": 1.64,
    "text": "Robinson."
  },
  {
    "start": 44.12,
    "duration": 3.72,
    "text": "Weather dependent."
  },
  {
    "start": 45.0,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "Yep. We've just parked up a little town."
  },
  {
    "start": 47.84,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "And now"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.92,
    "duration": 2.32,
    "text": "starting this walk. It's a little bit"
  },
  {
    "start": 50.12,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "drizzly,"
  },
  {
    "start": 51.24,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "but it's really warm."
  },
  {
    "start": 53.28,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "Yeah, the rain will keep us cool, mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 54.88,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "All right, unlike last time."
  },
  {
    "start": 55.76,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "Cuz it's it's really clammy."
  },
  {
    "start": 57.6,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "Anyway, guys, I'll bring you Mandingos"
  },
  {
    "start": 59.36,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "back in a minute. You know what I'm"
  },
  {
    "start": 61.52,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "talking about."
  },
  {
    "start": 62.96,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "Two rights."
  },
  {
    "start": 129.73,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "Jeez, Mandingo."
  },
  {
    "start": 137.73,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "2 mi each."
  },
  {
    "start": 141.73,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "Here we go."
  },
  {
    "start": 181.29,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "start": 182.49,
    "duration": 4.6,
    "text": "Really steep, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 184.21,
    "duration": 5.88,
    "text": "And this is just the start of it."
  },
  {
    "start": 187.09,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "That's where we're heading to."
  },
  {
    "start": 190.81,
    "duration": 4.72,
    "text": "Right over there."
  },
  {
    "start": 192.49,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "To the summit of Robinson."
  },
  {
    "start": 197.17,
    "duration": 2.64,
    "text": "I'm glad I didn't have a drink last"
  },
  {
    "start": 198.45,
    "duration": 4.48,
    "text": "night."
  },
  {
    "start": 199.81,
    "duration": 6.24,
    "text": "Young Chris had a few pints."
  },
  {
    "start": 202.93,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "Oh, there's me heart gone."
  },
  {
    "start": 207.89,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "Bloody hell, man."
  },
  {
    "start": 210.69,
    "duration": 4.64,
    "text": "Right, guys. I'll bring you back."
  },
  {
    "start": 212.65,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "When I get me heart."
  },
  {
    "start": 229.25,
    "duration": 2.96,
    "text": "10-minute break, mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 236.49,
    "duration": 2.88,
    "text": "Absolutely knackered."
  },
  {
    "start": 240.49,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "Right."
  },
  {
    "start": 241.61,
    "duration": 5.72,
    "text": "Going to have a 10 minute break."
  },
  {
    "start": 244.49,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "Nice drink of water."
  },
  {
    "start": 276.93,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": "You're burning."
  },
  {
    "start": 282.93,
    "duration": 4.16,
    "text": "Right folks, we've had a nice little"
  },
  {
    "start": 284.29,
    "duration": 6.12,
    "text": "break. 10 minutes."
  },
  {
    "start": 287.09,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "We've had a nice bottle of water."
  },
  {
    "start": 290.93,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "We're back on the path."
  },
  {
    "start": 296.17,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "This path will take us all the way to"
  },
  {
    "start": 298.21,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "the top of Robinson."
  },
  {
    "start": 300.41,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "So I'm going to go."
  },
  {
    "start": 302.17,
    "duration": 6.2,
    "text": "We will see you when we get to the top."
  },
  {
    "start": 305.21,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "You know what I'm talking about."
  },
  {
    "start": 357.29,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "My eye."
  },
  {
    "start": 373.3,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "Another 5-minute break mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 378.62,
    "duration": 4.56,
    "text": "Carry on."
  },
  {
    "start": 380.62,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "It'll be a long hard slog."
  },
  {
    "start": 383.18,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "We're getting there."
  },
  {
    "start": 383.89,
    "duration": 2.52,
    "text": "Getting there."
  },
  {
    "start": 404.06,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "I don't think it's much further now"
  },
  {
    "start": 405.3,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 412.25,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "The summit is in sight."
  },
  {
    "start": 416.3,
    "duration": 5.16,
    "text": "2 minutes away."
  },
  {
    "start": 418.3,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "Full on brutal be honest."
  },
  {
    "start": 422.77,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "First couple of days weren't really like"
  },
  {
    "start": 423.89,
    "duration": 2.04,
    "text": "this."
  },
  {
    "start": 426.33,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "Oh, it's still hard work."
  },
  {
    "start": 428.94,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "Bring it on"
  },
  {
    "start": 429.94,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "then guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 431.98,
    "duration": 2.24,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "start": 436.89,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "Here we are folks."
  },
  {
    "start": 439.1,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "Approaching the summit."
  },
  {
    "start": 441.18,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "Of Robinson."
  },
  {
    "start": 462.86,
    "duration": 4.88,
    "text": "We've found our spot guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 466.13,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "These are the views we're going to have."
  },
  {
    "start": 467.74,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "It'll be excellent mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 473.18,
    "duration": 2.36,
    "text": "It's a beautifully located area."
  },
  {
    "start": 474.33,
    "duration": 1.56,
    "text": "Perfecto mundo."
  },
  {
    "start": 475.54,
    "duration": 1.12,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "start": 475.89,
    "duration": 2.2,
    "text": "Mondingos."
  },
  {
    "start": 476.65,
    "duration": 2.96,
    "text": "Spot on."
  },
  {
    "start": 478.1,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "So we need to go back up the top and get"
  },
  {
    "start": 479.62,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "our bags cuz we've left them up there."
  },
  {
    "start": 481.89,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "While we had a"
  },
  {
    "start": 483.06,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "milch about."
  },
  {
    "start": 484.57,
    "duration": 1.64,
    "text": "All right, we're not going to get much"
  },
  {
    "start": 485.45,
    "duration": 2.36,
    "text": "better than this mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 486.21,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "Perfect I think mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 487.81,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "How wouldn't let's get the bugs and"
  },
  {
    "start": 489.62,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "these tents."
  },
  {
    "start": 490.9,
    "duration": 4.36,
    "text": "Set up."
  },
  {
    "start": 492.02,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "Classy, come on."
  },
  {
    "start": 505.22,
    "duration": 4.52,
    "text": "So we got lucky there folks."
  },
  {
    "start": 507.9,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "We were almost set up and then the"
  },
  {
    "start": 509.74,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "heavens opened."
  },
  {
    "start": 511.86,
    "duration": 4.6,
    "text": "Got a little bit wet."
  },
  {
    "start": 513.54,
    "duration": 5.16,
    "text": "We're quickly getting in there."
  },
  {
    "start": 516.46,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "Just getting our gear set up. So while"
  },
  {
    "start": 518.7,
    "duration": 5.08,
    "text": "I'm stuck indoors I'll"
  },
  {
    "start": 520.42,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "I'll show you me bits and pieces."
  },
  {
    "start": 525.38,
    "duration": 6.08,
    "text": "Like me gear."
  },
  {
    "start": 528.14,
    "duration": 6.44,
    "text": "Cheap foil thing down in the bottom."
  },
  {
    "start": 531.46,
    "duration": 6.4,
    "text": "I've got a Berghaus"
  },
  {
    "start": 534.58,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "self-inflating mat."
  },
  {
    "start": 538.62,
    "duration": 4.44,
    "text": "OEX"
  },
  {
    "start": 540.66,
    "duration": 4.64,
    "text": "200"
  },
  {
    "start": 543.06,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "sleeping bag. It's still nice and warm"
  },
  {
    "start": 545.3,
    "duration": 6.08,
    "text": "so that'll do the job."
  },
  {
    "start": 547.34,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "Cheap and cheerful technology pillow."
  },
  {
    "start": 554.26,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "That'll do for me."
  },
  {
    "start": 556.66,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "Food and drink wise or"
  },
  {
    "start": 558.58,
    "duration": 4.52,
    "text": "I've got"
  },
  {
    "start": 560.7,
    "duration": 5.96,
    "text": "six of these."
  },
  {
    "start": 563.1,
    "duration": 3.56,
    "text": "Rum and Cokes from Aldi's."
  },
  {
    "start": 567.26,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "1.20"
  },
  {
    "start": 568.74,
    "duration": 4.64,
    "text": "They're really nice."
  },
  {
    "start": 571.5,
    "duration": 4.12,
    "text": "I've also got"
  },
  {
    "start": 573.38,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "for some snacks"
  },
  {
    "start": 575.62,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "just some"
  },
  {
    "start": 576.7,
    "duration": 5.16,
    "text": "shortbread biscuits."
  },
  {
    "start": 579.1,
    "duration": 5.64,
    "text": "I've got some nice"
  },
  {
    "start": 581.86,
    "duration": 5.96,
    "text": "Italian meats."
  },
  {
    "start": 584.74,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "For me meal at the run."
  },
  {
    "start": 588.7,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "Some baby new potatoes."
  },
  {
    "start": 591.42,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "I've already cooked them in the"
  },
  {
    "start": 592.3,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "microwave at home for 6 minutes."
  },
  {
    "start": 595.02,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "So they'll easy cook in a couple of"
  },
  {
    "start": 596.3,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "minutes."
  },
  {
    "start": 598.14,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "And I've got me self a nice"
  },
  {
    "start": 600.5,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "text": "rump steak."
  },
  {
    "start": 601.98,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "Lovely jubbly."
  },
  {
    "start": 605.3,
    "duration": 5.4,
    "text": "Right, while I'm stuck indoors Jesus"
  },
  {
    "start": 608.22,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "Christ."
  },
  {
    "start": 611.18,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "While I'm stuck indoors,"
  },
  {
    "start": 613.46,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "I'm going to have one of these women"
  },
  {
    "start": 614.58,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "corks."
  },
  {
    "start": 616.14,
    "duration": 4.96,
    "text": "You know what I'm talking about, my"
  },
  {
    "start": 617.3,
    "duration": 6.64,
    "text": "ningos. This is serious wild camping."
  },
  {
    "start": 621.1,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "Right."
  },
  {
    "start": 626.46,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "Get the nice break in the weather, so I"
  },
  {
    "start": 628.18,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "thought I'd come out."
  },
  {
    "start": 630.78,
    "duration": 5.52,
    "text": "Show you our little"
  },
  {
    "start": 632.86,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "fantastic camping spot."
  },
  {
    "start": 637.06,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "text": "The views"
  },
  {
    "start": 638.5,
    "duration": 2.96,
    "text": "are spectacular."
  },
  {
    "start": 643.3,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "Look at that one."
  },
  {
    "start": 648.38,
    "duration": 5.0,
    "text": "Doesn't get much better than this."
  },
  {
    "start": 650.54,
    "duration": 5.12,
    "text": "Looking down at the Honister knots"
  },
  {
    "start": 653.38,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "and Crummock Water."
  },
  {
    "start": 655.66,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "There's Loweswater a little bit further"
  },
  {
    "start": 657.46,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "on."
  },
  {
    "start": 663.26,
    "duration": 5.88,
    "text": "So, I've got me old trusty faithful"
  },
  {
    "start": 666.02,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "Vango Orion."
  },
  {
    "start": 669.98,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "I quickly put it up there when it was"
  },
  {
    "start": 671.3,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "raining, so I'm going to"
  },
  {
    "start": 673.02,
    "duration": 4.12,
    "text": "I'm going to stretch it out a bit. It's"
  },
  {
    "start": 674.38,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "a bit saggy."
  },
  {
    "start": 678.02,
    "duration": 4.44,
    "text": "Young Chris is in his new tight again."
  },
  {
    "start": 682.54,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "Cloud Peak, isn't it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 684.42,
    "duration": 2.24,
    "text": "I."
  },
  {
    "start": 685.54,
    "duration": 3.56,
    "text": "Cloud Peak, too."
  },
  {
    "start": 686.66,
    "duration": 3.72,
    "text": "Decent tent."
  },
  {
    "start": 689.1,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "Let's see what food and drink you've"
  },
  {
    "start": 690.38,
    "duration": 5.12,
    "text": "got, mate. I've already shown mine."
  },
  {
    "start": 693.06,
    "duration": 4.6,
    "text": "Chicken meatballs."
  },
  {
    "start": 695.5,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "Got some spicy salami and cheese little"
  },
  {
    "start": 697.66,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "packs in there."
  },
  {
    "start": 698.98,
    "duration": 4.48,
    "text": "Some chorizo, and that's all going to go"
  },
  {
    "start": 701.42,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "inside"
  },
  {
    "start": 703.46,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "of them."
  },
  {
    "start": 705.74,
    "duration": 2.52,
    "text": "Two strong beers to go with that. Oh,"
  },
  {
    "start": 707.42,
    "duration": 1.52,
    "text": "yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 708.26,
    "duration": 1.36,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "start": 708.94,
    "duration": 1.76,
    "text": "Oh, yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 709.62,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "Amazing."
  },
  {
    "start": 710.7,
    "duration": 3.72,
    "text": "And I've got some wine."
  },
  {
    "start": 712.66,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "One kind of calling and then here you've"
  },
  {
    "start": 714.42,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "got I'm taking it easy tonight."
  },
  {
    "start": 715.94,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "Mhm."
  },
  {
    "start": 717.74,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "On a bit of a drinking ban."
  },
  {
    "start": 719.14,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "Class."
  },
  {
    "start": 721.7,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "For a drink in the shelter of oblivion."
  },
  {
    "start": 728.06,
    "duration": 3.72,
    "text": "Right, mate. I think while that um"
  },
  {
    "start": 730.38,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "rain stopped, I'm going to put me site"
  },
  {
    "start": 731.78,
    "duration": 1.68,
    "text": "up."
  },
  {
    "start": 732.78,
    "duration": 2.08,
    "text": "Just outside?"
  },
  {
    "start": 733.46,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "All right. Sit outside a bit."
  },
  {
    "start": 734.86,
    "duration": 3.52,
    "text": "I'll put me water first"
  },
  {
    "start": 736.06,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "Bring you back in a few minutes, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 738.38,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "We're going to sit"
  },
  {
    "start": 739.66,
    "duration": 2.32,
    "text": "and chill, have a couple of cans,"
  },
  {
    "start": 741.22,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 741.98,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "and taking these fantastic views."
  },
  {
    "start": 744.86,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "You know what makes sense?"
  },
  {
    "start": 746.18,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "Right."
  },
  {
    "start": 823.7,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "First one on the moon."
  },
  {
    "start": 835.74,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "Mustache."
  },
  {
    "start": 853.3,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "text": "Just busting a few minutes away, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 855.86,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "We've got about nowhere left. It's going"
  },
  {
