    "duration": 5.0,
    "text": "to be pitch black."
  },
  {
    "start": 859.18,
    "duration": 3.52,
    "text": "So, we've got to just stretch our legs."
  },
  {
    "start": 871.9,
    "duration": 4.48,
    "text": "Come back down soon."
  },
  {
    "start": 873.7,
    "duration": 4.56,
    "text": "A few more canned in goes, mandingos."
  },
  {
    "start": 876.38,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "I've got to plan the go."
  },
  {
    "start": 878.26,
    "duration": 2.32,
    "text": "And then, um"
  },
  {
    "start": 881.06,
    "duration": 2.04,
    "text": "Oh, I've got some whiskey. I've got to"
  },
  {
    "start": 882.66,
    "duration": 1.76,
    "text": "save that for later."
  },
  {
    "start": 883.1,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "Later on."
