    "duration": 4.16,
    "text": "one more bottle of coke."
  },
  {
    "start": 909.7,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "And then, I've got that little whiskey"
  },
  {
    "start": 911.18,
    "duration": 3.68,
    "text": "as well. That's all I have."
  },
  {
    "start": 912.82,
    "duration": 5.68,
    "text": "Well, now I've got a flask here."
  },
  {
    "start": 914.86,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "So much in it. I've got me back."
  },
  {
    "start": 919.1,
    "duration": 4.64,
    "text": "Do nicely for later. Give us a gobble."
  },
  {
    "start": 921.46,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "start": 934.86,
    "duration": 2.12,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "start": 943.58,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "I like that one to not even in the"
  },
  {
