    "duration": 2.2,
    "text": "this one cup."
  },
  {
    "start": 971.02,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "All right. That's easy for me."
  },
  {
    "start": 972.42,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "I'm going to share this."
  },
  {
    "start": 973.82,
    "duration": 5.52,
    "text": "Two guys, one cup. You know what I'm"
  },
  {
    "start": 976.22,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "talking about, Mandingo's."
  },
  {
    "start": 980.38,
    "duration": 3.72,
    "text": "Do you, mate?"
  },
  {
    "start": 982.38,
    "duration": 2.2,
