    "start": 1338.42,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "there to be honest, but I've still put"
  },
  {
    "start": 1339.98,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "them on."
  },
  {
    "start": 1342.74,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "So"
  },
  {
    "start": 1344.79,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "I'm I'm to say goodnight, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1346.83,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "I'm going to watch a movie."
  },
  {
    "start": 1348.63,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "I've got a couple of saved. I'll choose"
  },
  {
    "start": 1349.95,
    "duration": 2.96,
    "text": "one."
  },
  {
    "start": 1351.63,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "And I will see you Mandingos first thing"
  },
  {
    "start": 1352.91,
    "duration": 4.92,
    "text": "in the morning."
  },
  {
    "start": 1354.67,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "Coffee and biscuit time."
  },
  {
    "start": 1358.91,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "Good morning, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1361.31,
    "duration": 4.12,
    "text": "It's"
  },
  {
    "start": 1362.51,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "6:50."
  },
  {
    "start": 1368.99,
    "duration": 4.44,
    "text": "It's been absolutely lashing it down all"
  },
  {
    "start": 1370.99,
    "duration": 2.44,
    "text": "night."
  },
  {
    "start": 1376.11,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "I think young Chris is still asleep."
  },
  {
    "start": 1381.11,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "So, I'm going to have another knawer."
  },
  {
    "start": 1383.63,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "Just to chill."
  },
  {
    "start": 1384.95,
    "duration": 2.96,
    "text": "Make a nice coffee."
  },
  {
    "start": 1389.43,
    "duration": 3.56,
    "text": "Then I'll probably look at getting"
  },
  {
    "start": 1390.39,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "packed up."
  },
  {
    "start": 1393.07,
    "duration": 5.84,
    "text": "Cuz I think this rain"
  },
  {
    "start": 1395.31,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "is going to be in for a few hours yet."
  },
  {
    "start": 1400.67,
    "duration": 4.48,
    "text": "It's not too bad at the minute."
  },
  {
    "start": 1403.23,
    "duration": 3.68,
    "text": "It was miles worse just a few minutes"
  },
  {
    "start": 1405.15,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "ago."
  },
  {
    "start": 1406.91,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "And then, all right. So, I'm going to"
  },
  {
    "start": 1408.47,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "get a nice coffee on."
  },
  {
    "start": 1409.99,
    "duration": 5.36,
    "text": "Couple of biscuits."
  },
  {
    "start": 1412.23,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "Bring you back soon, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1469.75,
    "duration": 4.88,
    "text": "And that's that."
  },
  {
    "start": 1471.55,
    "duration": 6.28,
    "text": "So that's me all packed up, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1474.63,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "Young Chris is nearly done."
  },
  {
    "start": 1478.35,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "You can see where we've been. When we"
  },
  {
    "start": 1480.07,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "pick our bags up,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1481.79,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "we'll leave no mess."
  },
  {
    "start": 1484.35,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "Cuz all of our shite in that carrier"
  },
  {
    "start": 1485.71,
    "duration": 2.44,
    "text": "bag."
  },
  {
    "start": 1494.15,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "Have a last look at the views there."
  },
  {
    "start": 1499.27,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "Tremendous."
  },
  {
    "start": 1503.95,
    "duration": 4.48,
    "text": "So folks, once again, thank you very"
  },
  {
    "start": 1506.07,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "much for watching."
  },
  {
    "start": 1508.43,
    "duration": 2.24,
    "text": "It's been absolutely class, hasn't it,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1509.47,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "mate?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1510.67,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "The hike up yesterday was brutal."
  },
  {
    "start": 1513.11,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "That's what it's all about."
  },
  {
    "start": 1514.47,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "Well worth it in the end."
  },
  {
    "start": 1515.39,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "Certainly was, mate. Well worth it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1517.51,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "So I'm winding this up. If you've"
  },
  {
    "start": 1518.67,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "enjoyed that,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1519.99,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "give us a thumbs up."
  },
  {
    "start": 1521.47,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "Leave a comment. I'll reply to every one"
  },
  {
    "start": 1523.23,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "of you guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1524.51,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "If you haven't already subscribed,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1526.43,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "please consider doing that. You know it"
  },
  {
    "start": 1528.31,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "text": "makes sense. And I will see you next"
  },
  {
    "start": 1530.03,
    "duration": 4.96,
    "text": "time. Anything to say, mate?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1532.71,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "Well, apart from rights."
  },
  {
    "start": 1534.99,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "Rights."
  },
  {
    "start": 1536.19,
    "duration": 4.16,
    "text": "You know it makes sense."
  },
  {
    "start": 1537.27,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "See you next time, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1542.15,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "Oh, Mason."
  }
]